;; and EP-0015 issue 4 — `project-egress` of an `:rf.observe/handled-event`
;; record under `:rf.egress/off-box-observability` carries `:frame` /
;; `:event-id` / `:status` / `:elapsed-ms` / `:effects` / `:correlation` /
;; `:kind` and OMITS the `:event` args slot ENTIRELY. The off-box default
;; fails closed on the raw event payload: a hosted-monitoring sink consuming
;; the projected record never sees the dispatched arg-map.
