;; Mode-B pure-call (`:project-egress`): the `:rf.observe/handled-event`
;; record is projected directly, no dispatch loop. A frame
;; (`:obs/main`) is registered via `:fixture/frames` so the projector
;; resolves its classification (here empty — the omission is profile-driven,
;; not classification-driven). The off-box-observability profile floors
;; `:rf.size/include-sensitive? false`, and the handled-event projector drops
;; the `:event` key whenever sensitive content is not explicitly opted in.
;;
;; Mirrors the unit-level `re-frame.projection-cljs-test/handled-event-off-box-
;; omits-event-args` deftest AND the runtime e2e leg in
;; `re-frame.observability-routing-cljs-test/handled-event-routes-projected-
;; to-declared-sink` (rf2-t55hxg.7 / .4), lifted to the host-agnostic corpus.

